      <title>Best Liverpool FPL Picks with @DistanceCovered | Szoboszlai vs Wirtz?! | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Josh Williams (@DistanceCovered) joins us as he talks about the best Liverpool picks for Fantasy Premier League 2026/27. Szoboszlai vs Wirtz, Isak a pick? Best Liverpool defender? They're all answered on this FPL podcast.
