      <title>Bruno? Mbuemo? Maguire? Manchester United and FPL Meta chat with Mark Critchley | The FPL Wire | Fantasy Premier League Tips 2026/27</title>
      <description>We have Mark Critchley from The Athletic join us (who covers Manchester United) as we discuss Bruno and/ or Mbeumo, Maguire or Shaw, the FPL Meta and tons more Fantasy Premier League chat. Mark has two finishes in the top 2500 in the last few years, has built his own FPL model in the past and has not finished outside the top 100k in the last 9 years.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Sign up for Fantasy Football Hub - https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/landing/money-back-26?utm_source=affiliate&amp;utm_medium=affiliates&amp;utm_campaign=LR&amp;utm_content=money-back&amp;via=LR
Win Your Mini-league or get your Money-back (T&amp;C Apply) #ad 
━━━━━━━━━━━━━
We have THE legend of FPL YouTube content, Andy Let's Talk FPL, on to discuss his latest draft and current FPL dilemmas. We even discuss what a no Haaland strategy could look like.

💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire 
We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━
