3 Weeks remain in the Fantasy Premier League 2025/26 season and we have the last Double Gameweek with Manchester City and Crystal Palace playing twice. But do we even buy any Crystal Palace players or do we target Arsenal assets? Which players to target and who to sell for the last 3 weeks? 

Lots to unpack in this big episode!


