      <title>FPL Double Gameweek 24 and 25! Assistant Manager Active? | Fantasy Premier League Tips 2024/25</title>
      <link>https://youtube.com/live/4Mn4PvNWm0A</link>
      <description>It's now been confirmed that at least two teams will double in Gameweek 25. Should you activate your FPL Assistant Manager chip or stick with Triple Captain? Sell your third Liverpool player for Slot or gamble on Moyes? We break down the announcement and discuss the pros and cons of the various options
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 18:23:00 -0000</pubDate>
