gestions, FPL Stats, Eye-test and Fixture Analysis, Watchlists, Double Gameweek Previews all in a weekly FPL Podcast from established and experienced FPL Managers which will help you win your mini leagues and improve your Overall Rank. Content also includes interviews with established FPL Managers, Content Creators and FPL Tool Developers.</p><p><br></p><p>FPL Managers Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), Zophar666 (Top10k x 7), Pras (Top 10k x 4) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information, FPL Stats and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✏️Design:</p><p><br></p><p>Little More Services</p><p>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/littlemoreservicespvtltd/</p><p>FB:https://www.facebook.com/littlemoreservices/?fref=ts ;</p><p>Website: www.littlemoreservices.co.in</p><p><br></p><p>🎬Intro By:</p><p>Kaarvaan Pictures Social Media Properties (Aman Shah)</p><p>https://www.instagram.com/kaarvaanpic...</p><p>https://twitter.com/KaarvaanPics</p><p><br></p><p>🎨Animated By:</p><p>Falgun Busa</p><p>https://www.instagram.com/falgunbusa</p><p>https://twitter.com/FalgunBusa</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🍀Evergreen Videos:</p><p><br></p><p>FPL Wire Round Table with Mark Sutherns, FPL General, Adam Hopcroft and Tom Freeman: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NvhujsA8U9U&amp;t=2262s</p><p>Ragabolly Interview (creator of Live FPL): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SQvWHLxrtt8&amp;t=1689s</p><p>Tom Freeman Interview (8 finishes in the Top 10k): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gnPLRXGMuis&amp;t=1389s</p><p>FPL Salah Interview (4 finishes in the Top 1k): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fPiNaNcOTGM&amp;t=3899s</p><p>Neale Interview (Deputy Editor at Fantasy Football Scout): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QWTh6aCyH-c&amp;t=2448s</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>#FantasyPremierLeague #FPL #FantasyFootball #FPLTransfers #FPLWildcard #FPLGameweek #FantasyFootball #FPLWire #PremierLeague</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your a