        <![CDATA[<p>It was a rough FPL weekend but some tough decisions to be made - do we keep Saka? Is Trent a sell? What to do about DCL? Another game with 0 shots for Haaland! We cover this and a lot more in this Fantasy Premier League Gameweek 9 episode</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank?  </p><p><br></p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLWIRE</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire </p><p>We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Sleeper x FPL Wire League (Win Play Station 5 and Custom EPL Jerseys):</p><p>Join Our Pick Em League : https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FPLWirePickEm</p><p>Join our UCL PickEM League: https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FPLWireUCL</p><p>Download the iOS or Android app:</p><p>https://sleeperbot.onelink.me/KdzJ/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Grab your EXCLUSIVE NordVPN Deal by going to https://nordvpn.com/fplwire to get a Huge Discount off your NordVPN Plan + 4-additional months for free! It’s completely risk free with Nord’s 30 day money-back guarantee!</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔔 SUBSCRIBE: </p><p>https://www.youtube.com/c/TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🐦Follow Us On Twitter:</p><p><br></p><p>Lateriser12: https://twitter.com/lateriser12</p><p>Zophar: https://twitter.com/zopharfpl</p><p>Pras: https://twitter.com/Pras_fpl</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🎧 Also listen on: </p><p><br></p><p>Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/5c9qKwPsPUjAxZ9WTT5nUM</p><p>Apple Podcast: https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/the-fpl-wire/id1530847697</p><p>Google: https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8zNGNlZGVkYy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==</p><p>Overcast: https://overcast.fm/itunes1530847697/the-fpl-wire</p><p>Anchor: https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire</p><p>PocketCasts: https://pca.st/hqd6z519</p><p>RSS: https://anchor.fm/s/34