      <description>The FPL curtain raiser is under 2 weeks away and we have Josh Williams (https://x.com/DistanceCovered) talking to us about the Best FPL Liverpool picks. Josh is one of the best Liverpool analysts out there and works regularly with The Anfield Wrap and Redmen TV. We talk Slot, Trent, Mo, Jota and more! This one is a banger. 
