        <![CDATA[<p>The FPL curtain raiser is under 2 weeks away and we have Josh Williams (https://x.com/DistanceCovered) talking to us about the Best FPL Liverpool picks. Josh is one of the best Liverpool analysts out there and works regularly with The Anfield Wrap and Redmen TV. We talk Slot, Trent, Mo, Jota and more! This one is a banger. </p><p>Josh's Substack - http://distancecovered.substack.com</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank?  </p><p><br></p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLWIRE</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire </p><p>We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Sleeper x FPL Wire League (Win Play Station 5 and Custom EPL Jerseys):</p><p>https://sleeper.com/i/00jBDM10DGG2</p><p>Android App:</p><p>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.sleeperbot.lite</p><p>iOS App:</p><p>https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/sleeper-fantasy-football/id987367543</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔔 SUBSCRIBE: </p><p>https://www.youtube.com/c/TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🐦Follow Us On Twitter:</p><p><br></p><p>Lateriser12: https://twitter.com/lateriser12</p><p>Zophar: https://twitter.com/zopharfpl</p><p>Pras: https://twitter.com/Pras_fpl</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🎧 Also listen on: </p><p><br></p><p>Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/5c9qKwPsPUjAxZ9WTT5nUM</p><p>Apple Podcast: https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/the-fpl-wire/id1530847697</p><p>Google: https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8zNGNlZGVkYy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==</p><p>Overcast: https://overcast.fm/itunes1530847697/the-fpl-wire</p><p>Anchor: https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire</p><p>PocketCasts: https://pca.st/hqd6z519</p><p>RSS: https://anchor.fm/s/34cededc/podcast/rss</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>👨‍💼About Us:</p><p><br></p><p>Everything Fantasy Premier League (FPL) under one roof. We love Fantasy Footb