      <title>FPL Man City Preview | The FPL Wire | Fantasy Premier League Tips 2023/24</title>
      <description>Pras is joined by Luke (@dis_fpl) to talk about Man City players we can consider for our FPL teams. The two discuss Man City's transfer activities and implications this season, the Community shield game vs Arsenal and 4 possible formations Pep could play this season.
