        <![CDATA[<p>Pras is joined by Luke (@dis_fpl) to talk about Man City players we can consider for our FPL teams. The two discuss Man City's transfer activities and implications this season, the Community shield game vs Arsenal and 4 possible formations Pep could play this season.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire</p><p>We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank?</p><p><br></p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔔 SUBSCRIBE:</p><p>https://www.youtube.com/c/TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🐦Follow Us On Twitter:</p><p><br></p><p>Lateriser12: https://twitter.com/lateriser12</p><p>Zophar: https://twitter.com/zopharfpl</p><p>Pras: https://twitter.com/Pras_fpl</p><p>BigManBakar: https://twitter.com/BigManBakar</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🎧 Also listen on:</p><p><br></p><p>Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/5c9qKwP...</p><p>Apple Podcast: https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast...</p><p>Google: https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=...</p><p>Overcast: https://overcast.fm/itunes1530847697/...</p><p>Anchor: https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire</p><p>PocketCasts: https://pca.st/hqd6z519</p><p>RSS: https://anchor.fm/s/34cededc/podcast/rss</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>👨‍💼About Us:</p><p><br></p><p>Everything Fantasy Premier League (FPL) under one roof. We love Fantasy Football.</p><p><br></p><p>The FPL Wire is a place where you get all your Fantasy Football Tips, Gameweek Previews, Captaincy &amp; Transfer Suggestions, FPL Stats, Eye-test and Fixture Analysis, Watchlists, Double Gameweek Previews all in a weekly FPL Podcast from established and experienced FPL Managers which will help you win your mini leagues and improve your Overall Rank. Content also includes interviews with established FPL Managers, Content Creators and FPL Tool Developers.</p><p><br></p