👨‍💼About Us:

Everything Fantasy Premier League (FPL) under one roof. We love Fantasy Football.

The FPL Wire is a place where you get all your Fantasy Football Tips, Gameweek Previews, Captaincy &amp; Transfer Suggestions, FPL Stats, Eye-test and Fixture Analysis, Watchlists, Double Gameweek Previews all in a weekly FPL Podcast from established and experienced FPL Managers which will help you win your mini leagues and improve your Overall Rank. Content also includes interviews with established FPL Managers, Content Creators and FPL Tool Developers.

FPL Managers Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), Zophar666 (Top10k x 7), Pras (Top 10k x 4) and BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information, FPL Stats and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.
