        <![CDATA[<p>It's the penultimate Gameweek of the 2022/23 Fantasy Premier League season with Chelsea, Brighton, Man. Utd and Man City doubling. Which FPL assets will play twice? Should you go against Haaland for captaincy? We answer these questions and more.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire </p><p>We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank?  </p><p><br></p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Fantasypaedia Link: https://twitter.com/Fantasypaedia</p><p>Tickets for North vs South Charity Game:</p><p>https://www.gw39northvsouth.co.uk/</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔔 SUBSCRIBE: </p><p>https://www.youtube.com/c/TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🐦Follow Us On Twitter:</p><p><br></p><p>Lateriser12: https://twitter.com/lateriser12</p><p>Zophar: https://twitter.com/zophar666</p><p>BigManBakar: https://twitter.com/BigManBakar</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🎧 Also listen on: </p><p><br></p><p>Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/5c9qKwPsPUjAxZ9WTT5nUM</p><p>Apple Podcast: https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/the-fpl-wire/id1530847697</p><p>Google: https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8zNGNlZGVkYy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==</p><p>Overcast: https://overcast.fm/itunes1530847697/the-fpl-wire</p><p>Anchor: https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire</p><p>PocketCasts: https://pca.st/hqd6z519</p><p>RSS: https://anchor.fm/s/34cededc/podcast/rss</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>👨‍💼About Us:</p><p><br></p><p>Everything Fantasy Premier League (FPL) under one roof. We love Fantasy Football.</p><p><br></p><p>The FPL Wire is a place where you get all your Fantasy Football Tips, Gameweek Previews, Captaincy &amp; Transfer Suggestions, FPL Stats, Eye-test and Fixture Analysis, Watc