        <![CDATA[<p>With only Five gameweeks to go in Fantasy Premier League, it's time to go big in FPL Double Gameweek 34. Bakar returns to join Lateriser and Zophar as they discuss DGW picks team by team.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire</p><p>We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank?</p><p><br></p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Fantasypaedia Link: https://twitter.com/Fantasypaedia</p><p>Tickets for North vs South Charity Game:</p><p>https://www.gw39northvsouth.co.uk/</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔔 SUBSCRIBE:</p><p>https://www.youtube.com/c/TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🐦Follow Us On Twitter:</p><p><br></p><p>Lateriser12: https://twitter.com/lateriser12</p><p>Zophar: https://twitter.com/zophar666</p><p>BigManBakar: https://twitter.com/BigManBakar</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🎧 Also listen on:</p><p><br></p><p>Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/5c9qKwPsPUjAxZ9WTT5nUM</p><p>Apple Podcast: https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/the-fpl-wire/id1530847697</p><p>Google: https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8zNGNlZGVkYy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==</p><p>Overcast: https://overcast.fm/itunes1530847697/the-fpl-wire</p><p>Anchor: https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire</p><p>PocketCasts: https://pca.st/hqd6z519</p><p>RSS: https://anchor.fm/s/34cededc/podcast/rss</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>👨‍💼About Us:</p><p><br></p><p>Everything Fantasy Premier League (FPL) under one roof. We love Fantasy Football.</p><p><br></p><p>The FPL Wire is a place where you get all your Fantasy Football Tips, Gameweek Previews, Captaincy &amp; Transfer Suggestions, FPL Stats, Eye-test and Fixture Analysis, Watchlists, Double Gameweek Previews all in a weekly FPL Podcast fr