        <![CDATA[<p>With a super quick turnaround to GW12, the trio discuss Maddison replacements, Salah, Captaincy, 1 GW punt for wildcarders and more!</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire </p><p>We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank?  </p><p><br></p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔔 SUBSCRIBE: </p><p>https://www.youtube.com/c/TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🐦Follow Us On Twitter:</p><p><br></p><p>Lateriser12: https://twitter.com/lateriser12</p><p>Zophar: https://twitter.com/zophar666</p><p>BigManBakar: https://twitter.com/BigManBakar</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔌This Podcast is powered by DreamSetGo</p><p><br></p><p>DreamSetGo is a sports travel &amp; experiences platform,offering sporting events and player-interaction packages to die-hard fans.The vision of DreamSetGo is to make sports fans live the dream through their bespoke sports experiences.</p><p><br></p><p>For more information visit - https://www.dreamsetgo.co/?utm_medium=youtube&amp;utm_source=thefplwire&amp;utm_campaign=thefpltips</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🎧 Also listen on: </p><p><br></p><p>Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/5c9qKwPsPUjAxZ9WTT5nUM</p><p>Apple Podcast: https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/the-fpl-wire/id1530847697</p><p>Google: https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8zNGNlZGVkYy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==</p><p>Overcast: https://overcast.fm/itunes1530847697/the-fpl-wire</p><p>Anchor: https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire</p><p>PocketCasts: https://pca.st/hqd6z519</p><p>RSS: https://anchor.fm/s/34cededc/podcast/rss</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>👨‍💼About Us:</p><p><br></p><p>Everything Fantasy Premier League (FPL) under one roof. We love Fantasy Football.</p><p><br></p><p>The FPL Wi