      <title>Gameweek 10 Pod | The FPL Wire | Fantasy Premier League Tips 2022/23</title>
      <description>Not much time to edit with a Thursday evening pod so have released it unedited this time to get it out for the Friday commutes. 
The goals were flying in! Is big at the back dead? What do we do about Man City with the GW12 blank in mind? The trio discuss these and a lot more questions
