      <description>The biggest double gameweek of the season is here but there are some dilemmas - Which Man City players to target after 120 mins midweek? Should Leicester be ignored even with Everton/Norwich at home? Should you play your Free hit in 36 or 37? Lateriser and Zophar discuss all this and more
