      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Leicester are through in the Europa League, what does it mean for their assets in DGW33 and beyond? Chelsea could double in GW34! Lots to talk about this week </p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire </p><p>We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank?  </p><p><br></p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - http://bit.ly/FPLTheWire</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔔 SUBSCRIBE: </p><p>https://www.youtube.com/c/TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🐦Follow Us On Twitter:</p><p><br></p><p>Lateriser12: https://twitter.com/lateriser12</p><p>Zophar: https://twitter.com/zophar666</p><p>BigManBakar: https://twitter.com/BigManBakar</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔌This Podcast is powered by DreamSetGo. </p><p><br></p><p>DreamSetGo is a sports travel &amp; experiences platform,offering sporting events and player-interaction packages to die-hard fans.The vision of DreamSetGo is to make sports fans live the dream through their bespoke sports experiences.</p><p><br></p><p>For more information visit - https://www.dreamsetgo.co/?utm_medium=youtube&amp;utm_source=thefplwire&amp;utm_campaign=thefpltips</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🎧 Also listen on: </p><p><br></p><p>Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/5c9qKwPsPUjAxZ9WTT5nUM</p><p>Apple Podcast: https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/the-fpl-wire/id1530847697</p><p>Google: https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8zNGNlZGVkYy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==</p><p>Overcast: https://overcast.fm/itunes1530847697/the-fpl-wire</p><p>Anchor: https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire</p><p>PocketCasts: https://pca.st/hqd6z519</p><p>RSS: https://anchor.fm/s/34cededc/podcast/rss</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>👨‍💼About Us:</p><p><br></p><p>Everything Fantasy Premier League (FPL) under one roof. We love Fantasy Football.</p><p><br></p><p>The FPL Wire is a place where you get all your Fantasy Football Tips, Gameweek Previews, Captaincy &amp; Transfer Suggestions, FPL Stats, Eye-test and Fixture Analysis, Watchlists, Double Gameweek Previews all in a weekly FPL Podcast from established and experienced FPL Managers which will help you win your mini leagues and improve your Overall Rank. Content also includes interviews with established FPL Managers, Content Creators and FPL Tool Developers.</p><p><br></p><p>FPL Managers Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information, FPL Stats and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✏️Design:</p><p>Simon Stanford</p><p>https://www.instagram.com/simon.creative</p><p>https://twitter.com/FalcoFPL</p><p><br></p><p>🎬Intro By:</p><p>Kaarvaan Pictures Social Media Properties (Aman Shah)</p><p>https://www.instagram.com/kaarvaanpic...</p><p>https://twitter.com/KaarvaanPics</p><p><br></p><p>🎨Animated By:</p><p>Falgun Busa</p><p>https://www.instagram.com/falgunbusa</p><p>https://twitter.com/FalgunBusa</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🍀Evergreen Videos:</p><p><br></p><p>FPL Wire Round Table with Mark Sutherns, FPL General, Adam Hopcroft and Tom Freeman: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NvhujsA8U9U&amp;t=2262s</p><p>Ragabolly Interview (creator of Live FPL): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SQvWHLxrtt8&amp;t=1689s</p><p>Tom Freeman Interview (8 finishes in the Top 10k): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gnPLRXGMuis&amp;t=1389s</p><p>FPL Salah Interview (4 finishes in the Top 1k): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fPiNaNcOTGM&amp;t=3899s</p><p>Neale Interview (Deputy Editor at Fantasy Football Scout): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QWTh6aCyH-c&amp;t=2448s</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>#FantasyPremierLeague #FPL #FantasyFootball #FPLTransfers #FPLWildcard #FPLGameweek #FantasyFootball #FPLWire #PremierLeague</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
