      <title>FPL Double Gameweek 26 | The FPL Wire | Fantasy Premier League Tips 2021/22</title>
      <link>https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire/episodes/FPL-Double-Gameweek-26--The-FPL-Wire--Fantasy-Premier-League-Tips-202122-e1ehd9p</link>
      <description>The Big Double Gameweek 26 is here! Eight teams play twice, FPL Wire is back as we look ahead at Gameweek 26 and beyond in Fantasy Premier League. We kept the content under an hour this time and the last 20 minutes were Q &amp; A

━━━━━━━━━━━━━

💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.

