      <description>FPL is back and we look back at all the Fantasy talking points from Gameweek 2 and also discuss Lukaku, Strikers and dive deep into captaincy for Gameweek 3. Vote for us in the FCAs (Best in Fantasy Football - Podcast): http://footballcontentawards.com/voting

Timestamps: 0:00 Waiting Screen  0:08 Introduction  0:41 Bakar GW Review  1:25 LR GW Review  2:35 Sponsor Plugs  3:48 Review: GW2   45:45 Football Content Awards  46:41 Team Discussion: Chelsea  59:02 Player Data: Forwards  1:01:25 Wildcard Discussion  1:07:22 Captaincy  1:21:35 LR’s Team Plans  1:23:42 Bakar’s Team Plans  1:29:36 Zoph’s Team Plans  1:30:54 Q&amp;A  1:38:15 Closing

