      <title>The FPL Wire Roundtable | The FPL Wire | Fantasy Premier League 2021/22</title>
      <link>https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire/episodes/The-FPL-Wire-Roundtable--The-FPL-Wire--Fantasy-Premier-League-202122-e15grtj</link>
      <description>We are joined by Fantasy Royalty on our first Round Table. We lay back and talk about everything FPL. There are 38 Top 10k finishes and 14 Top 500 finishes on this one! We don't like using the word FPL experts, but these guys would make as good a case as any. Our guests are: Mark Sutherns (@FFScout_Mark) Mark Mcgettigan (@FPLGeneral) Tom Freeman (@FPLCruyff74) Adam Hopcroft (@ahopcroft13)

⌚Timestamps: 0:00 Start 0:05 Title Theme 0:23 Intro to FPL Royalty 3:14 Sponsor Plugs 3:52 Rapid Fire Round 16:50 Why have you been successful? And have you changed in the last 3 years? 26:37 What are your weaknesses? + FPL Traps 35:50 Dealing with red arrows and bad gameweeks 45:05 Pre Season Process 55:55 Mid Season Process 1:08:52 Sounding Boards 1:16:40 Do you play differently when you get up into the good ranks? 1:24:25 Career Goals 1:32:34 FPL Algorithms 1:40:48 Predicting what will define this season (21/22) 1:44:29 What is the differentiating skill in FPL? 1:51:45 Last words

━━━━━━━━━━━━━

💛Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire We really appreciate all the support shown to us through SuperChats.

