<p>👨‍💼About Us:  Everything Fantasy Premier League (FPL) under one roof. We love Fantasy Football.  The FPL Wire is a place where you get all your Fantasy Football Tips, Gameweek Previews, Captaincy &amp; Transfer Suggestions, FPL Stats, Eye-test and Fixture Analysis, Watchlists, Double Gameweek Previews all in a weekly FPL Podcast from established and experienced FPL Managers which will help you win your mini leagues and improve your Overall Rank. Content also includes interviews with established FPL Managers, Content Creators and FPL Tool Developers.  FPL Managers Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information, FPL Stats and banter you need to make your FPL decisions. ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p>
<p>🍀Evergreen Videos:  Ragabolly Interview (creator of Live FPL): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SQvWHLxrtt8&amp;t=1689sTom Freeman Interview (8 finishes in the Top 10k): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gnPLRXGMuis&amp;t=1389sFPL Salah Interview (4 finishes in the Top 1k): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fPiNaNcOTGM&amp;t=3899sNeale Interview (Deputy Editor at Fantasy Football Scout): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QWTh6aCyH-c&amp;t=2448s━━━━━━━━━━━━━  </p>
<p>#FantasyPremierLeague #FPL #FantasyFootball #FPLTransfers #FPLWildcard #FPLGameweek #FantasyFootball #FPLWire #PremierLeague </p>
