        <![CDATA[<p>Timestamps: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM">0:00</a> Opening  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=31s">0:31</a>Tom GW Review  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=67s">1:07</a> LR GW Review  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=417s">6:57</a> Agenda  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=465s">7:45</a> Bakar’s Stats  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=932s">15:32</a> Team Data-Defence  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=1625s">27:05</a> Team Data-Attack  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=2014s">33:34</a> Player Data-Creativity  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=2168s">36:08</a> Player Data-Goal Threat  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=2420s">40:20</a> DGW 26 Discussion  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=5296s">1:28:16</a> Blank GW 29 Discussion  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=5756s">1:35:56</a> LR’s Team Plans  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=5863s">1:37:43</a> Bakar’s Team Plans  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=5897s">1:38:17</a> Zoph’s Team Plans  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=6142s">1:42:22</a> Captains  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP3DuM_MFPM&amp;t=6428s">1:47:08</a> Q&amp;A</p>
<p>In this episode, Lateriser and Zophar are joined by Tom Freeman (@FPLCruyff74) who has 8 Top 10k finishes to his name. Both Zophar and Tom are on Wildcard as they discuss the upcoming Double Gameweeks and their different approach to the wildcard!</p>
<p>Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire</p>
