      <description>Just a note. There have been some DGW announcements after the pod which we haven't covered. Follow @BenCrellin for relevant news.

In this episode, Lateriser, Zophar &amp; Bakar look back at GW21/22, Upcoming Double Gameweeks, Man Utd, BHA &amp; More.

Support us: https://www.patreon.com/thefplwire

