      <description>In this episode, Lateriser &amp; Zophar chat with Ragabolly who is the creator of LiveFPL.net &amp; Virtual FPL. A fascinating chat with a genius who is as humble as they come. They talk about LiveFPL, Effective Ownership, His love for the game and lots more!

