&lt;p&gt;In this episode, Lateriser, Zophar &amp;amp; BigManBakar talk in depth about Blank Gameweek 18, Double Gameweek 19, Chip Strategy &amp;amp; Future Blank &amp;amp; Double Gameweeks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
