&lt;p&gt;The FPL Wire is a place where Fantasy Managers @Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), @Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp;amp; @BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) who have loved the game for years (and have done pretty well if we may say so) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this episode, Lateriser and Zophar are joined by Abdul Rehman (@FPL_Salah) who has 4 Top 1k finishes to his name. They talk Abdul's strategy, his good start to the season, Pep Roulette, Man Utd &amp;amp; More.&lt;/p&gt;
