      <title>"Do You Go Diogo?" - The FPL Wire - Ep 11 - Fantasy Premier League (FPL) TIPS 2020/21</title>
      <link>https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire/episodes/Do-You-Go-Diogo----The-FPL-Wire---Ep-11---Fantasy-Premier-League-FPL-TIPS-202021-emu6cb</link>
      <description>Timecodes 00:00 - Intro 00:13 - LR GW review 01:03 - Zoph GW review 01:14 - Neale introduction 01:48 - Neale GW review 04:04 - Interview with Neale 28:22 - Top 5 premium assets 40:28 - Whipping boys 50:30 - Is DCL a glue pick? 54:50 - Team discussion - New Castle 1:00:34 - Team discussion - Liverpool 1:06:50 - Fixtures 1:19:08 - Differentials 1:21:09 - LR team plans 1:22:00 - Zoph team plans 1:23:48 - Neale team plans 1:29:44 - Q&amp;A 1:46:00 - Closing



The FPL Wire is a place where Fantasy Managers @Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), @Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; @BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) who have loved the game for years (and have done pretty well if we may say so) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.



In this episode, Lateriser and Zophar are joined by Neale Rigg (@SkontoRigga) who is the Deputy Edtior at Fantasy Football Scout and top FPL Manager. They talk with Neale about life doing FPL full time, rank the premium attackers, discuss the whipping boys and look at Liverpool, Newcastle &amp; More.



