      <description>00:00 - Opening 00:42 - LR GW review 01:22 - Zoph GW review 01:36 - Tom GW review 03:07 - Agenda 03:50 - Zoph's WC 11:42 - WC Dilemas 21:28 - Spurs conundrum 29:03 - International break injuries 35:00 - Jota vs Ziyech 44:50 - Team discussion - Man United 54:28 - Team discussion - Man City 1:04:28 - Team discussion - Leicester 1:10:04 - Fixtures 1:22:20 - Differentials 1:25:55 - Bakar's stats 1:28:50 - LR's team plans 1:29:52 - Tom's team plans 1:34:25 - Bakar's team plans 1:35:02 - Q&amp;A 1:45:00 - Closing



The FPL Wire is a place where Fantasy Managers @Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), @Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; @BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) who have loved the game for years (and have done pretty well if we may say so) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.

In this episode, Lateriser and Zophar are joined by Tom Freeman (@FPLCruyff74) who has 8 Top 10k finishes to his name. They talk about Zophar's wildcard, Internation Break Injures, Spurs Fixture Shift, The Manchester Clubs, Leicester City &amp; More. 

