      <link>https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire/episodes/Zoph-takes-no-prisoners---The-FPL-Wire---Ep-8---Fantasy-Premier-League-FPL-TIPS-202021-ell76v</link>
      <description>0:00 - Opening 0:42 - Not butchering Van Dijk :D 0:46 - Gameweek review LR 0:54 - Gameweek review Bakar 1:00 - Gameweek review Zoph 1:10 - Tom Freeman introduction 2:35 - Agenda 3:07 - Interview with Tom 25:35 - Hot topic Everton 29:21 - Hot topic Man City 35:43 - Mid price mids 45:59 - Team discussion - Chelsea 52:57 - Team discussion - Villa 58:35 - Team discussion - Southampton 1:01:46 - Fixtures 1:11:09 - Differentials 1:13:02 - Bakar's stats 1:15:56- GW 7 Team plan - LR 1:17:14 - GW 7 Team plan - Tom 1:19:18 - GW 7 Team plan - Zoph 1:19:40 - GW 7 Team plan - Bakar 1:20:00 - Q&amp;A 1:32:12 - Closing

The FPL Wire is a place where Fantasy Managers @Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), @Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; @BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) who have loved the game for years (and have done pretty well if we may say so) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.

In this episode, Lateriser and Zophar are joined by Tom Freeman (@FPLCruyff74) who has 8 Top 10k finishes to his name. They talk about Tom's FPL Strategy, his key to success, Everton &amp; City assets, Mid price Midfielders, Chelsea, Aston Villa &amp; More.

FPL Tips, Stats &amp; Preview for Fantasy Premier League (FPL) Gameweek 8

This Podcast is powered by DreamSetGo. DreamSetGo is a sports travel &amp; experiences platform,offering sporting events and player-interaction packages to die-hard fans.The vision of DreamSetGo is to make sports fans live the dream through their bespoke sports experiences.

