      <description>Timestamps from @PompeyInUganda   2:40 Agenda  3:51 Liverpool Defence  9:16 Defensive Options (Detailed!) 41:18 Kane Vs Other Strikers  49:12 How to deal with the polarising season (mental health)  54:34 Teams - Wolves 58:11 Teams - Leeds 1:03:03 Teams - Aston Villa  1:05:44 Fixtures 1:14:30 Bakar's stats of the week 1:16:40 Differentials 1:17:14 Lateriser's Team 1:20:32 Bakar's Team 1:21:27 Zophar's Team 1:24:24 Questions from the community

The FPL Wire is a place where Fantasy Managers @Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), @Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; @BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) who have loved the game for years (and have done pretty well if we may say so) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.

In this episode, they talk about Liverpool Defence, Defensive Options, Kane vs Other Strikers, Polarizing seasons, Wolves, Leeds, Villa, Captains, Differentials and The Wire Derby. 



