      <link>https://anchor.fm/the-fpl-wire/episodes/Kane-De-Bruyne---The-FPL-Wire---Ep-6---Fantasy-Premier-League-FPL-TIPS-202021-el0c97</link>
      <description>Timestamps from @PompeyInUganda  00:00 Gameweek reviews: 04:52 Agenda 05:38 Anomaly Games Reasoning 11:52 Remove Cash Out of Defence + Liverpool Defence 17:22 Be Patient with City Assets + Jimenez 29:57 Wildcard Top Picks - Defence 33:47 Wildcard Top Picks - Midfield 35:31 Wildcard Top Picks - Attack 43:30 Team Discussion - Spurs 53:05 Team Discussion - Villa 47:29 Team Discussion - Palace 59:50 Fixtures Gameweek 5 1:07:56 Captain Discussion 1:11:38 Bakar's Top 3 Stats 1:14:58 Differentials  1:16:07 Lateriser Gameweek 5 Team  1:17:31 Bakar Gameweek 5 Team 1:19:06 Zophar Gameweek 5 Team 1:20:14 Questions from Community

In this episode, they talk about Anomaly Games, Removing Cash Out of Defence, Not Overreacting, Patience with City assets and Jimenez, Wildcard picks, Spurs, Aston Villa, Palace, Captainces, Hot Fixtures and more.  

The FPL Wire is a place where Fantasy Managers @Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), @Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; @BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) who have loved the game for years (and have done pretty well if we may say so) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.

Also available on Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtIPFexB6PLKNNl0XH3SKKw?view_as=subscriber

FPL Tips, Stats &amp; Preview for Fantasy Premier League (FPL) Gameweek 6  

