        <![CDATA[<p>In this episode they talk about Werner, Strikers, Son, Midfielders, Penalties, Hot Fixtures, Captains &amp; Differentials.</p>
<p>Timestamps: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=40s">0:40</a> LR GW3 Review <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=61s">1:01</a> BigMan GW3 Review <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=108s">1:48</a> Zophar GW3 Review  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=162s">2:42</a> Hot Topics Ahead  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=212s">3:32</a> Team Discussion: Chelsea   <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=789s">13:09</a> Werner Replacements(Premium and Cheap Options)  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=1996s">33:16</a> Son Replacements  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=2495s">41:35</a> Penalties and Penalty Takers  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=2720s">45:20</a> Team Discussion: West Ham <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=2974s">49:34</a> Team Discussion: West Brom <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=3209s">53:29</a> Team Discussion: Leeds  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=3515s">58:35</a> Fixtures  Preview : GW4   <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=3952s">1:05:52</a> Captaincy  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=4135s">1:08:55</a> Top 3 Stats for  the GW  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=4307s">1:11:47</a> Differential Pick for the Week  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=4340s">1:12:20</a> GW4 Team- LR <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=4480s">1:14:40</a> GW4 Team- BigMan  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=4667s">1:17:47</a> GW4 Team- Zophar  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULkeKuXKCck&amp;t=4741s">1:19:01</a> Q&amp;A</p>
<p>The FPL Wire is a place where Fantasy Managers @Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), @Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; @BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) who have loved the game for years (and have done pretty well if we may say so) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information and banter you need to make your FPL decisions.</p>
<p>Also on Youtube. </p>
