      <description>The FPL Wire is a place where Fantasy Managers @Lateriser12 (Top 200 x 3), @Zophar666 (Top10k x 7) &amp; @BigManBakar (#4 in 2014/15) who have loved the game for years (and have done pretty well if we may say so) discuss the Fantasy Premier League (FPL) on a weekly basis hoping to give you all the insight, information and banter you need to make your FPL decisions. You can also find them on Youtube.

In this episode they talk about their Wildcard plans, Kai Havertz, going with Mo Salah, lessons learnt in Pre-Season and cast a deeper look at Everton, Newcastle United &amp; Leicester City.   

FPL Tips, Stats &amp; Preview for Fantasy Premier League (FPL) Gameweek 1.

